    "description": "Software developer on various projects across multiple teams. Contract to hire converted after 1 year.\n\n• Built cloud-based call management solution for call center agents to replace a legacy Internet Explorer extension with a more modular system; this allowed fine-grained control of data and removed the need to install an agent on the desktops and reducing agent downtime by 15%\n• Built NodeJS backend that used Edge.js to proxy data between Node and the provided Cisco .Net DLL\n• Contributed to backend for new customer servicing application for call center agents to simplify the agent's workflow and reduce average handle time per call; the NodeJS backend handled fetching and proxying information between the application and the internal Capital One API ecosystem\n• Incorporated real time customer insights from Apache Kafka streams into customer servicing application for call center agents",
